        "original_id": "40b78d12-9f94-523a-90c0-03ef27a5aedf",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Scott Workman\n- Roles: stuntman, actor\n- TV Shows: The X-Files, Buffy the Vampire Slayer, Sons of Anarchy\n- Organizations: ABC, CBS, NBC, Fox, WB Television Network\n- Concepts: television ratings\n\nFacts:\n- William Scott Workman was born on September 16, 1966.\n- William Scott Workman was an American stuntman and actor.\n- Scott Workman had a career that spanned more than 20 years.\n- Scott Workman had television credits on The X-Files, Buffy the Vampire Slayer, and Sons of Anarchy.\n- Buffy the Vampire Slayer had ratings that were lower than successful shows on ABC, CBS, NBC, and Fox.\n- Buffy the Vampire Slayer's ratings were considered a success for the relatively new and smaller WB Television Network.\n- William Scott Workman died on September 29, 2013.",
